Cell["\<\
One geodesic at infra-scale 3 of exactly 6 edges from the centre of the grid, \
as a vertex sequence.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8856d913-a2e2-4849-9545-c862fadefdcf"],

